{"id":"3d-interactive","title":"3D Interactive — CSS Scene","description":"A rotating 3D cube built with pure CSS transforms — drag to spin it, release for inertia, or let it auto-rotate. No WebGL, no libraries. For tech products and premium brand moments.","tags":["3d","interactive","css"],"type":"code","link":null,"updated":"2026-10-11T18:27:25.337Z","docs":{"file":"design.md","raw":"---\ntitle: 3D Interactive — CSS Scene\ndescription: A rotating 3D cube built with pure CSS transforms — drag to spin it, release for inertia, or let it auto-rotate. No WebGL, no libraries. For tech products and premium brand moments.\ntags: [3d, interactive, css]\norder: 5\n---\n\n# 3D Interactive — CSS Scene\n\nProof that \"3D website\" doesn't require WebGL: a perspective scene, six transformed faces and a JS pointer handler with velocity and inertia.\n\n## Tokens\n\n| Token | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Stage | `#0e0f13` with a soft radial glow |\n| Cube size | 220px, faces use gradient + big glyph |\n| Face set A | blue→cyan duotone |\n| Face set B | magenta→violet duotone |\n| Type | system sans, mono for the HUD readout |\n\n## Interaction\n\n- **Drag** anywhere on the stage to rotate (pointer events).\n- **Release** with velocity → inertia decay.\n- Idle for 2s → slow auto-rotation resumes.\n- Theme buttons swap the face gradients via CSS variables.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — self-contained, no dependencies, works offline.\n","body":"\n# 3D Interactive — CSS Scene\n\nProof that \"3D website\" doesn't require WebGL: a perspective scene, six transformed faces and a JS pointer handler with velocity and inertia.\n\n## Tokens\n\n| Token | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Stage | `#0e0f13` with a soft radial glow |\n| Cube size | 220px, faces use gradient + big glyph |\n| Face set A | blue→cyan duotone |\n| Face set B | magenta→violet duotone |\n| Type | system sans, mono for the HUD readout |\n\n## Interaction\n\n- **Drag** anywhere on the stage to rotate (pointer events).\n- **Release** with velocity → inertia decay.\n- Idle for 2s → slow auto-rotation resumes.\n- Theme buttons swap the face gradients via CSS variables.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — self-contained, no dependencies, works offline.\n"},"files":[{"path":"index.html","lang":"html","content":"\u003c!DOCTYPE html>\n\u003chtml lang=\"en\">\n\u003chead>\n\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n\u003cmeta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n\u003ctitle>CUBE — 3D Interactive\u003c/title>\n\u003cstyle>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  body { font-family: \"Segoe UI\", system-ui, sans-serif; background: radial-gradient(1000px 600px at 50% 20%, #1b1d26, #0e0f13 70%); color: #e8eaf2; min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; overflow: hidden; user-select: none; }\n  .hud { position: fixed; top: 18px; left: 0; right: 0; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 0 22px; font-family: Consolas, ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 11.5px; color: #7a8095; letter-spacing: 0.12em; }\n  .hud b { color: #e8eaf2; }\n  h1 { font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.35em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #9aa1b5; margin-bottom: 6px; }\n  .hint { font-size: 12.5px; color: #5d647a; margin-bottom: 26px; }\n\n  .scene { width: 240px; height: 240px; perspective: 900px; cursor: grab; touch-action: none; }\n  .scene:active { cursor: grabbing; }\n  .cube { width: 100%; height: 100%; position: relative; transform-style: preserve-3d; transform: rotateX(var(--rx, -18deg)) rotateY(var(--ry, 24deg)); }\n  .face { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 64px; font-weight: 800; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25); background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--face-a), var(--face-b)); box-shadow: inset 0 0 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25); }\n  .f1 { transform: translateZ(120px); }\n  .f2 { transform: rotateY(180deg) translateZ(120px); }\n  .f3 { transform: rotateY(90deg) translateZ(120px); }\n  .f4 { transform: rotateY(-90deg) translateZ(120px); }\n  .f5 { transform: rotateX(90deg) translateZ(120px); }\n  .f6 { transform: rotateX(-90deg) translateZ(120px); }\n\n  :root { --face-a: #2563eb; --face-b: #22d3ee; }\n  body.violet { --face-a: #d946ef; --face-b: #6366f1; }\n  body.sunset { --face-a: #f97316; --face-b: #facc15; }\n  body.mono { --face-a: #3f3f46; --face-b: #18181b; }\n\n  .controls { margin-top: 34px; display: flex; gap: 10px; }\n  .controls button { font: inherit; font-size: 12.5px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #c9cdda; background: #181a22; border: 1px solid #2c2f3c; border-radius: 999px; padding: 8px 16px; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s; }\n  .controls button:hover { border-color: #4c5164; color: #fff; }\n  .controls button.active { background: #e8eaf2; color: #12131a; border-color: #e8eaf2; }\n  .readout { margin-top: 20px; font-family: Consolas, ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #5d647a; }\n\u003c/style>\n\u003c/head>\n\u003cbody>\n  \u003cdiv class=\"hud\">\u003cspan>NEXUS/SCENE \u003cb>01\u003c/b>\u003c/span>\u003cspan>WEBGL COUNT: \u003cb>0\u003c/b> · CSS ONLY\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n  \u003ch1>The Cube\u003c/h1>\n  \u003cdiv class=\"hint\">Drag to rotate · release to spin\u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"scene\" id=\"scene\">\n    \u003cdiv class=\"cube\" id=\"cube\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"face f1\">◆\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"face f2\">✦\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"face f3\">▲\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"face f4\">●\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"face f5\">■\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"face f6\">✺\u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n  \u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"controls\">\n    \u003cbutton class=\"active\" data-theme=\"\">Ocean\u003c/button>\n    \u003cbutton data-theme=\"violet\">Violet\u003c/button>\n    \u003cbutton data-theme=\"sunset\">Sunset\u003c/button>\n    \u003cbutton data-theme=\"mono\">Mono\u003c/button>\n  \u003c/div>\n  \u003cdiv class=\"readout\" id=\"readout\">rx -18.0° · ry 24.0° · idle-spin on\u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cscript>\n    const scene = document.getElementById('scene');\n    const cube = document.getElementById('cube');\n    const readout = document.getElementById('readout');\n    let rx = -18, ry = 24, vx = 0, vy = 0.4, dragging = false, px = 0, py = 0, idleTimer;\n\n    scene.addEventListener('pointerdown', e => {\n      dragging = true; px = e.clientX; py = e.clientY;\n      vx = vy = 0; clearTimeout(idleTimer);\n      scene.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId);\n    });\n    scene.addEventListener('pointermove', e => {\n      if (!dragging) return;\n      const dx = e.clientX - px, dy = e.clientY - py;\n      ry += dx * 0.4; rx -= dy * 0.4;\n      vy = dx * 0.4; vx = -dy * 0.4;\n      px = e.clientX; py = e.clientY;\n    });\n    addEventListener('pointerup', () => {\n      dragging = false;\n      idleTimer = setTimeout(() => { vy = Math.max(0.25, Math.abs(vy)); }, 2000);\n    });\n\n    (function loop() {\n      if (!dragging) {\n        ry += vy; rx += vx;\n        vx *= 0.95; vy *= 0.95;\n        if (Math.abs(vy) \u003c 0.25) vy += (0.3 - vy) * 0.02; // ease into idle spin\n        rx = Math.max(-80, Math.min(80, rx));\n      }\n      cube.style.setProperty('--rx', rx + 'deg');\n      cube.style.setProperty('--ry', ry + 'deg');\n      readout.textContent = 'rx ' + rx.toFixed(1) + '° · ry ' + ry.toFixed(1) + '° · ' + (dragging ? 'dragging' : 'inertia');\n      requestAnimationFrame(loop);\n    })();\n\n    document.querySelectorAll('.controls button').forEach(b => {\n      b.addEventListener('click', () => {\n        document.querySelectorAll('.controls button').forEach(x => x.classList.remove('active'));\n        b.classList.add('active');\n        document.body.className = b.dataset.theme;\n      });\n    });\n  \u003c/script>\n\u003c/body>\n\u003c/html>\n"}],"preview":{"file":"index.html","html":"\u003c!DOCTYPE html>\n\u003chtml lang=\"en\">\n\u003chead>\u003cscript>(function(){try{window.localStorage.getItem(\"__probe__\")}catch(e){var s={};var o={getItem:function(k){return k in s?s[k]:null},setItem:function(k,v){s[k]=String(v)},removeItem:function(k){delete s[k]},clear:function(){s={}},key:function(i){return Object.keys(s)[i]||null}};Object.defineProperty(o,\"length\",{get:function(){return Object.keys(s).length},configurable:true});try{Object.defineProperty(window,\"localStorage\",{value:o,configurable:true})}catch(e2){}}})();\u003c/script>\n\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n\u003cmeta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n\u003ctitle>CUBE — 3D Interactive\u003c/title>\n\u003cstyle>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  body { font-family: \"Segoe UI\", system-ui, sans-serif; background: radial-gradient(1000px 600px at 50% 20%, #1b1d26, #0e0f13 70%); color: #e8eaf2; min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; overflow: hidden; user-select: none; }\n  .hud { position: fixed; top: 18px; left: 0; right: 0; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 0 22px; font-family: Consolas, ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 11.5px; color: #7a8095; letter-spacing: 0.12em; }\n  .hud b { color: #e8eaf2; }\n  h1 { font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.35em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #9aa1b5; margin-bottom: 6px; }\n  .hint { font-size: 12.5px; color: #5d647a; margin-bottom: 26px; }\n\n  .scene { width: 240px; height: 240px; perspective: 900px; cursor: grab; touch-action: none; }\n  .scene:active { cursor: grabbing; }\n  .cube { width: 100%; height: 100%; position: relative; transform-style: preserve-3d; transform: rotateX(var(--rx, -18deg)) rotateY(var(--ry, 24deg)); }\n  .face { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 64px; font-weight: 800; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25); background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--face-a), var(--face-b)); box-shadow: inset 0 0 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25); }\n  .f1 { transform: translateZ(120px); }\n  .f2 { transform: rotateY(180deg) translateZ(120px); }\n  .f3 { transform: rotateY(90deg) translateZ(120px); }\n  .f4 { transform: rotateY(-90deg) translateZ(120px); }\n  .f5 { transform: rotateX(90deg) translateZ(120px); }\n  .f6 { transform: rotateX(-90deg) translateZ(120px); }\n\n  :root { --face-a: #2563eb; --face-b: #22d3ee; }\n  body.violet { --face-a: #d946ef; --face-b: #6366f1; }\n  body.sunset { --face-a: #f97316; --face-b: #facc15; }\n  body.mono { --face-a: #3f3f46; --face-b: #18181b; }\n\n  .controls { margin-top: 34px; display: flex; gap: 10px; }\n  .controls button { font: inherit; font-size: 12.5px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #c9cdda; background: #181a22; border: 1px solid #2c2f3c; border-radius: 999px; padding: 8px 16px; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s; }\n  .controls button:hover { border-color: #4c5164; color: #fff; }\n  .controls button.active { background: #e8eaf2; color: #12131a; border-color: #e8eaf2; }\n  .readout { margin-top: 20px; font-family: Consolas, ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #5d647a; }\n\u003c/style>\n\u003c/head>\n\u003cbody>\n  \u003cdiv class=\"hud\">\u003cspan>NEXUS/SCENE \u003cb>01\u003c/b>\u003c/span>\u003cspan>WEBGL COUNT: \u003cb>0\u003c/b> · CSS ONLY\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n  \u003ch1>The Cube\u003c/h1>\n  \u003cdiv class=\"hint\">Drag to rotate · release to spin\u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"scene\" id=\"scene\">\n    \u003cdiv class=\"cube\" id=\"cube\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"face f1\">◆\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"face f2\">✦\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"face f3\">▲\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"face f4\">●\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"face f5\">■\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"face f6\">✺\u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n  \u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"controls\">\n    \u003cbutton class=\"active\" data-theme=\"\">Ocean\u003c/button>\n    \u003cbutton data-theme=\"violet\">Violet\u003c/button>\n    \u003cbutton data-theme=\"sunset\">Sunset\u003c/button>\n    \u003cbutton data-theme=\"mono\">Mono\u003c/button>\n  \u003c/div>\n  \u003cdiv class=\"readout\" id=\"readout\">rx -18.0° · ry 24.0° · idle-spin on\u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cscript>\n    const scene = document.getElementById('scene');\n    const cube = document.getElementById('cube');\n    const readout = document.getElementById('readout');\n    let rx = -18, ry = 24, vx = 0, vy = 0.4, dragging = false, px = 0, py = 0, idleTimer;\n\n    scene.addEventListener('pointerdown', e => {\n      dragging = true; px = e.clientX; py = e.clientY;\n      vx = vy = 0; clearTimeout(idleTimer);\n      scene.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId);\n    });\n    scene.addEventListener('pointermove', e => {\n      if (!dragging) return;\n      const dx = e.clientX - px, dy = e.clientY - py;\n      ry += dx * 0.4; rx -= dy * 0.4;\n      vy = dx * 0.4; vx = -dy * 0.4;\n      px = e.clientX; py = e.clientY;\n    });\n    addEventListener('pointerup', () => {\n      dragging = false;\n      idleTimer = setTimeout(() => { vy = Math.max(0.25, Math.abs(vy)); }, 2000);\n    });\n\n    (function loop() {\n      if (!dragging) {\n        ry += vy; rx += vx;\n        vx *= 0.95; vy *= 0.95;\n        if (Math.abs(vy) \u003c 0.25) vy += (0.3 - vy) * 0.02; // ease into idle spin\n        rx = Math.max(-80, Math.min(80, rx));\n      }\n      cube.style.setProperty('--rx', rx + 'deg');\n      cube.style.setProperty('--ry', ry + 'deg');\n      readout.textContent = 'rx ' + rx.toFixed(1) + '° · ry ' + ry.toFixed(1) + '° · ' + (dragging ? 'dragging' : 'inertia');\n      requestAnimationFrame(loop);\n    })();\n\n    document.querySelectorAll('.controls button').forEach(b => {\n      b.addEventListener('click', () => {\n        document.querySelectorAll('.controls button').forEach(x => x.classList.remove('active'));\n        b.classList.add('active');\n        document.body.className = b.dataset.theme;\n      });\n    });\n  \u003c/script>\n\u003c/body>\n\u003c/html>\n"}}